ence's  emotions she doesn't seem to empathize  with them at all  she simply presents them matter of  factly  it would seem that grindelwald despite  terrifying her earlier in the movie  doesn't need to be careful with queenie  she seems to feel that she's made the  right choice which brings us to the  secrets of dumbledore trailer here we  are presented with a very confident less  colorful version of the queenie we have  come to know and love  she's present in just a couple scenes  one of which looks to be a flashback  queenie and jacob were embracing in his  bakery back in new york  here her hair is the rich gold color it  used to be and she's wearing the same  pink outfit that she wore the end of the  first film when she shows up at the  bakery  the second scene though is the only  current depiction we get of queenie in  the trailer dressed all in black with  slicked back platinum blonde hair she  carries herself with a certain strength  and purpose we haven't seen from queenie  before gone is the happy-go-lucky charm  that she used to bounce around with  so what could this mean for queenie in  the secret of dumbledore  well i think it's pretty clear that  she's gotten a bit lost in her pursuit  of being free to love whomever she wants  i would wager that even though she tells  herself that her love of jacob is why  she's fighting alongside grindelwald she  barely even thinks about him anymore  instead she's motivated by the power  she's assuming  she's finally found a reason to invest  in her magical abilities for a greater  purpose  something more than just being another  macusa employee or an ilvermorny  professor  for the greater good i think that in  this upcoming film we're going to see a  whole new side of queenie a powerful  woman who thanks to her talent as a  legilimens has perhaps become one of  grindelwald's most trusted acolytes i  believe we'll see her present for many  meetings of importance in the movie so  that she can share the thoughts and  desires of those grindelwald is meeting  with  sadly i think in her misguided attempt  to secure a future in which she thinks  she'll have the freedom to love jacob  she will actually come up against jacob  and the others i think she'll believe  she's doing it for the greater good  and unfortunately i think this will mean  that more tragedy is on the way for our  protagonists newt jacob and tina i'm  hopeful that by the end of the secrets  of dumbledore queenie will recognize  that she's taken an unwise turn down a  dark path and that she'll return to her  old self once more i don't think we'll  get the overly bubbly queenie that we  first met in fantastic beasts but  perhaps that's not altogether a bad  thing  hopefully the queenie that emerges will  be a more confident witch who values her  abilities and her purpose but with some  of her old charm left intact well that's  it for today's video as always i'd love  to know what you think what do you  believe will be queenie's role in the  new movie  let me know your thoughts in the  comments below and if you enjoyed this  video don't forget to like it and  subscribe to the channel until next time  for the greater good  you

